1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,740
Never been one for talking

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,260
Just to hear the sound

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,500
If I say it, I'll back it

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:12,740
Every step on the ground

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:15,300
I don't swear on anything

6
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:19,540
Don't need a handshake or a pen

7
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,000
Every word I say I mean
